{%- comment -%}
  Hera Wig Try-on — App embed (Online › Wig Try-on, spec: claude/WIG_TRYON_FEATURE_SPEC.md §13)
  Added 2026-11-05 to the existing theme extension (same app as Hera Swatch).

  Server-side (here):
    - product pages only; the Hub switch decides (app metafield hera_tryon.config):
        mode 'live'    -> always
        mode 'preview' -> only in the theme editor or on *.shopifypreview.com
        mode 'off'     -> nothing is output
    - product.type must be in the Hub's product type list (case-insensitive;
      translated type names may be listed there too).
    - outputs the data the widget needs: product id / title, logged-in or not,
      login URL, position of the colour selected on the page, texts.
      Wig name + colours (with Swatch images and the hidden rules) come from the Hub
      in English via /status — never translated (Hera 2026-11-05).
  The icon and the window are drawn by assets/hera-tryon.js; styles in hera-tryon.css.
  All calls go to the Hub through the Shopify App Proxy ({{ proxyPath }}, e.g. /apps/hera-tryon).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign ht_on = false
  assign ht = app.metafields.hera_tryon.config.value
  if template.name == 'product' and product and ht and ht.version
    if ht.mode == 'live'
      assign ht_on = true
    elsif ht.mode == 'preview'
      if request.design_mode or request.host contains 'shopifypreview.com'
        assign ht_on = true
      endif
    endif
  endif
  if ht_on
    assign ht_type = product.type | strip | upcase
    unless ht.types contains ht_type
      assign ht_on = false
    endunless
  endif

  if ht_on
    # Window title "{Wig name} Try on": product metafield custom.wig_name (Hera 2026-11-05),
    # falls back to the product title when the metafield is empty.
    assign ht_name = product.metafields.custom.wig_name.value | strip
    if ht_name == blank
      assign ht_name = product.title
    endif
    assign ht_lang = 'en'
    if request.locale.iso_code == 'fr'
      assign ht_lang = 'fr'
    endif

    # Colour option: the Swatch rule's option for this product type, else Color / Colour / Couleur.
    assign hs_cfg = app.metafields.hera_swatch.config.value
    assign ht_opt = nil
    assign ht_pos = 0
    if hs_cfg and hs_cfg.rules
      for rule in hs_cfg.rules
        if ht_pos > 0
          break
        endif
        unless rule.productTypes contains product.type
          continue
        endunless
        assign want = rule.optionName | strip | downcase
        for opt in product.options_with_values
          assign have = opt.name | strip | downcase
          if have == want
            assign ht_opt = opt
            assign ht_pos = forloop.index
            break
          endif
        endfor
      endfor
    endif
    if ht_pos == 0
      for opt in product.options_with_values
        assign have = opt.name | strip | downcase
        if have == 'color' or have == 'colour' or have == 'couleur'
          assign ht_opt = opt
          assign ht_pos = forloop.index
          break
        endif
      endfor
    endif

    assign ht_idx = ht_pos | minus: 1
  endif
-%}
{%- if ht_on -%}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ 'hera-tryon.css' | asset_url }}" media="all">
<script type="application/json" id="hera-tryon-data">
{
  "productId": {{ product.id | json }},
  "title": {{ ht_name | json }},
  "titleIsEnglish": {% if ht_lang == 'en' %}true{% else %}false{% endif %},
  "lang": {{ ht_lang | json }},
  "loggedIn": {% if customer %}true{% else %}false{% endif %},
  "requireLogin": {{ ht.requireLogin | json }},
  "loginUrl": {{ routes.account_login_url | json }},
  "proxyPath": {{ ht.proxyPath | default: '/apps/hera-tryon' | json }},
  "privacyUrl": {{ ht.privacyUrl | default: '/policies/privacy-policy' | json }},
  "gallerySelector": {{ ht.gallerySelector | json }},
  "iconUrl": {% if ht.iconFile != blank %}{{ ht.iconFile | file_url | json }}{% else %}""{% endif %},
  "iconSize": {{ ht.iconSize | default: 48 }},
  "iconOffset": {{ ht.iconOffset | default: 12 }},
  "swatchStyle": {
    "w": {{ hs_cfg.style.cardWidth | default: 72 }},
    "h": {{ hs_cfg.style.imageHeight | default: 81 }},
    "accent": {{ hs_cfg.style.accentColor | default: '#E32A69' | json }},
    "pos": {{ hs_cfg.style.imagePosition | default: 'center top' | json }}
  },
  {%- comment -%}
    Colours come from the Hub (/status, Admin API = English) since 2026-11-05: on the
    French store Liquid returns translated option values, which don't match the
    Swatch codes. Here we only pass WHICH colour is selected on the page, as its
    position in the colour option (the same in every language).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  "selectedIndex": {%- liquid
    assign ht_sel_i = -1
    if ht_pos > 0
      assign ht_sel_v = product.selected_or_first_available_variant.options[ht_idx]
      for v in ht_opt.values
        if v == ht_sel_v
          assign ht_sel_i = forloop.index0
          break
        endif
      endfor
    endif
    echo ht_sel_i
  -%},
  "t": {{ ht.ui[ht_lang] | json }},
  "tEn": {{ ht.ui.en | json }},
  "debug": {{ block.settings.debug | json }}
}
</script>
<script src="{{ 'hera-tryon.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Hera Wig Try-on",
  "target": "body",
  "enabled_on": { "templates": ["product"] },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "debug",
      "label": "Debug log",
      "info": "Prints the try-on data in the browser console.",
      "default": false
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
